'''Seabreeze Coppermine''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] gacha event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Coppermine]] that was added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 494
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Seabreeze Coppermine
|name2 = Seabreeze Coppermine, type κ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Seabreeze Coppermine, type κ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Seabreeze Coppermine has a surprising number of strengths, although she does have some downsides. Targeting 3 different traits is very good, as they're all decent traits to target, though her use is heavily offset by the fact that she has very bad uptime. Not all is lost as, like her [[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|original counterpart]], she is blessed with a fast cooldown.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

